METHODOLOGICAL NOTE: the current preprocessed BOLD was ALREADY band-pass filtered to
0.01-0.10 Hz during preprocessing (frozen pipeline step). ALFF is therefore computed on
the full available spectrum of this already-band-limited signal -- since negligible power
exists outside 0.01-0.10 Hz post-filtering, this is effectively equivalent to the
traditional ALFF definition (amplitude summed within that band). This is a documented
consequence of the frozen pipeline, not a methodological substitution.
