======================================================================
STEP 2 -- ReHo (voxel-level, 27-neighbor KCC, then aggregated to 246 ROIs)
======================================================================
Neighborhood definition: 27-voxel cube (3x3x3, INCLUDING the center voxel itself).
Reason: this is the original Zang et al. (2004) ReHo definition and the default used by
AFNI 3dReHo and DPARSF/DPABI -- the most common and best-validated choice in the
literature. Not chosen arbitrarily.
Edge/boundary voxels: neighbors are restricted to those also inside the brain mask, so K
(the number of time series in the KCC formula) may be <27 near the mask boundary -- this
is standard practice (matches AFNI 3dReHo behavior) and is explicitly accounted for in the
Kendall's W formula below (K varies per voxel, not fixed at 27).
